  m_text: "Game Instructions\r\n\r\nControls:\r\n\u2022 WASD - Move Around\r\n\u2022
    Mouse - Look Around\r\n\u2022 Space - Jump\r\n\u2022 Shift - Crouch\r\n\u2022
    E - Interact with objects\r\n\r\nObjectives:\r\n\u2022 Find the Key under the
    Dining table (Crouch to see it)\r\n\u2022 Pick the Key by pressing 'E'\r\n\u2022
    Use the Key to open the Door\r\n\u2022 Go near the TV to turn it On/Off using
    'E'\r\n\u2022 Find the Key, open the Door, and stand on the floor mat to enter
    the jump training area\r\n\r\nPress OK to begin!\r\n"
